OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school's potential closure
OL,4,Ato go to consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school's closure could be
OL,7,Fnecessary to reduce the number of
OL,8,Fsurplus pupil places in a Berkshire
OL,9,Fborough, a council has said.
OL,11,FAlexander First School in Windsor
OL,12,Feducates about 90 pupils, with many of
OL,13,Fthem from military families with
OL,14,Fparents based at the nearby Victoria
OL,15,Fand Combermere Barracks.
OL,17,FLast month the Royal Borough of Windsor
OL,18,Fand Maidenhead's (RBWM) cabinet
OL,19,Fapproved a plan to seek views on the
OL,20,Fschool's potential closure at the end
OL,21,Fof the 2027/28 academic year.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
