OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school's potential closure
OL,4,Ato go to consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree RBWM councillors said they wanted
OL,7,Fthe decision reconsidered but its
OL,8,Fadults, children and health overview
OL,9,Fand scrutiny panel said it thought the
OL,10,Fconsultation should take place.
